  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global summit of the Strong Cities Network, New York City, 19-21 Sep. 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish support will allow local leaders and representatives from ODA-eligible countries to participate in the summit. Their participation is likely to increase their knowledge on how city-led efforts may prevent and respond to violent extremism, build resilience and enhance social cohesion.  Their participation also enables engagement with relevant UN bodies that are engaged in preventing and countering violent extremism (P/CVE) to elevate the voices of local leaders and the perspectives of local authorities in the UN&#x2019;s P/CVE efforts. The event is therefore also relevant for Denmark&#xb4;s UN Security Council membership campaign.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enable more relevant mayors, city officials and other local leaders from ODA-eligible countries to participate in the Strong Cities Summit and increase their knowledge on how city-led efforts may prevent and respond to violent extremism, build resilience and enhance social cohesion.</narrative>
  </description>
